msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But seeing as you’re good enough friends for him to let you stay here,⟪k:1⟫I assume he’s "
"also spilled everything?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫그 녀석이 이 저택에 체재시킬 만한 사이라면――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그 녀석이 죄다 불었을 거 아"
"닌가?"

