msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If you come clean, I might even let you go.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Get rid of him, have you take his "
"place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫낱낱이 불면…… ⟪k:2⟫풀어 줄 것도 같은데.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그 녀석을 없애고 ⟪k:5⟫너를 빈자리에 채"
"우는 수도 있어."

